  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hIzbcyhQ\">相关链接：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-a8MoaG6F\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-0jv5FoSo\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710731761676\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取定向包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Okgvz8Hl\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710735901711\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">创建定向包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QdOkRv5C\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710732349455\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">更新定向包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1M8kNcmx\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710732991488\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">删除定向包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-cY6hdPUm\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710733675532\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">计划绑定定向包</a></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aqoTCd8O\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710734283776\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">定向包解绑</a></li></ul><hr style=\"background-color: rgb(232, 232, 232); border: 1px solid transparent; margin: 18px 0px;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Nb7FuBhN\">定向包是将常用的定向设置形成模板保存下来，方便在创建计划时重复使用同样的定向条件，通过本篇的接口您可以对自己的定向包进行增、删、改、查的操作。</p></div>",
